# Exception: the pinned W-V1 legacy fixture corpus is a committed test *input*,
# not generated output.  Its bytes are pinned by SHA-256 in
# specs_and_reports/v2/W-V1/manifest.tsv and that file is the manifest the
# E3-G legacy half and the C08 gate both verify against.
!specs_and_reports/v2/W-V1/*.mapr

